  m_text: "<b><i>ASTRONAUT</b></i>\r\nI have defeated the Great Evil. It turns out,
    they were an artificial intelligence the entire time. Once I vanquished them,
    they went into self-destruct mode and blew up the third planet, known as \xC6rth.
    Over.\r\n\r\n"
