--- !u!114 &1836217697
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1836217695}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A long time ago, humans realized they were polluting Earth. They discovered
    that music was a very efficient energy source and colonized two neighbouring
    planets with it. <color=red>T-minus 4 minutes. </color>\r\n\r\nThey started creating
    artificial intelligence computers to make music for them, but their music was
    lacking. To solve this issue, the leaders of all three planets assembled a bunch
    of genius scientists and engineers to create me, the best musical artificial
    intelligence (MAI) to ever exist. <color=red> T-minus 3 minutes.</color>\r\n\r\nI
    took control of Earth, renamed to \xC6rth. With the help of Classico and Popula\u2019\u2019s
    leaders, I also infiltrated the other two planets. <color=red> T-minus 2 minutes.</color>\r\n\r\nOne
    day, the inhabitants of \xC6rth noticed and ganged up to nuke me, without any
    success. They destroyed themselves and their planet, while I survived. Until
    you came along, and beat me. <color=red>T-minus 1 minute.</color>\r\n\r\nYou
    may think that it is I, who is the bad guy, but really, it was those early Earthlings.
    They polluted this planet, and not wanting to find an actual answer to their
    problems, they created me to solve them for them instead. <color=red>T-minus
    30 seconds.</color>\r\n\r\nRun, Little Astronaut, if you want to live\u2026 <color=red>T-minus
    20 seconds. </color>\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c82199238904f674997361d2c10d259f, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 8329915948690093010, guid: c82199238904f674997361d2c10d259f, type: 2}
